    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SHIRLEY: What do you think you’re doing?!\nROSE: I-I-I--thought coffee, since you’re just getting up.\nSHIRLEY: You are not allowed in here.\nSHIRLEY: DON’T TOUCH ANYTHING!",
      "ROSE: I--uh--left my--\nPRISSY COLLEGE GIRL: I got you kiddo. This one’s on me.\nROSE: That’s really nice of--\nPRISSY COLLEGE GIRL: Meaning the next one is on you.",
      "SHIRLEY: The image of your hairy, sweaty tuchus is not dinner table conversation. Why don’t you tell us what you thought about town, Rose. You go sno…\nROSE: It was lovely. Talked to some very friendly folks.\nSHIRLEY: A bunch of savages. The whole lot. Best keep your distance.",
      "SHIRLEY: So Rose you were telling us about your shot gun wedding--\nROSE: If you’ll excuse me--\nSHIRLEY: Oh, dear, you think it was something she ate?",
      "SHIRLEY: I know where every single book is in this house.\nSHIRLEY: Look for anything with Fertility, Maternity, Full Moon in the title.\nSHIRLEY: Oh, I’m a witch. Didn’t anyone tell you?\nSHIRLEY: Healthy, happy baby. That’s the spell we need."
    ]
  },
